 "english": {
  "elements": [
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Taking sugarcane, squeezing Tamil from it—in the flower,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "taking the bee that comes bearing honey,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "taking the bud, the gathering of women smiles:",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Even the food that ants carry away",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "was given by our king, generous Kumanan,” they say—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Kongu land strides in exultation.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 18
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "*",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 18
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Every poet who sings Tamil",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "comes singing Kumanan's praise—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "words roar like the waves of the resounding sea;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the melody of the nectar called Tamil resounds;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "a fragrant garden of flowers of verse—a gathering",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "of hearts where love glides.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 18,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "page-transition",
    "fromScan": 18,
    "toScan": 19,
    "stanzaRelation": "unknown",
    "textualRelation": "not-specifically-recorded",
    "evidence": {
     "stanza": [],
     "textual": []
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "With seal-stamped Tamil shaping verse,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "there was a poet named Perunchithiranar—a great scholar!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "A chaste wife, children, and the womb that bore the poet—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "treasures like gold of the purest touch;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "yet the joy he found upon this earth was poverty,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and he grew terribly thin through hunger day after day!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "His wife wilted and withered like a flower;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "his mother curled up like a worm;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "from hunger, his child rolled the pot about like a cat!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The poet stood wringing his hands;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "then he remembered generous Kumanan,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "whose hand had reddened from giving, and set out.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 19
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "*",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 19
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Cast away the thought,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "‘After Pari and Kari, who remains to give?’",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Scoop up the wealth I give!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "O Kongu king who beats his chest proclaiming,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "‘Kumanan is but another name for rain!’",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "I have one request—my family,” he said.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The king poured out gifts.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“I need gold to live.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "On the road by which I came lived Veliman;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "I walked there to receive what he would give.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Alas, king! A year has passed since he died—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "his younger brother Ilaveliman is there now;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "he refuses to give,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and speaks a cruel reply.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "O guardian who rules wealth-pouring Mudiramalai!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "To break the arrogance of that base Ilaveliman,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "give me an elephant;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "let it be tied to his guard-tree,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "so that the low fellow must bow his head.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Give it to me,” he said.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Kumanan gave it.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 19,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "page-transition",
    "fromScan": 19,
    "toScan": 20,
    "stanzaRelation": "unknown",
    "textualRelation": "not-specifically-recorded",
    "evidence": {
     "stanza": [],
     "textual": []
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Just as heroic Veliman had a younger brother, Ilaveliman,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "King Kumanan too had one;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "his name was Ilankumanan.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Jewels, elephants, armies, palaces—all of them—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "if you give them away just so poets may live,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "our country, brother, will become a mendicant's monastery",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "without even a scrap of cloth!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "I cannot allow this any longer;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "divide my share for me right now,” he said.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“I have seen the trees of fruit-shedding Mudiramalai—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and I have seen your mouth, brother,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "shedding red unripe fruit.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "What jewels do I need?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "What do I need in the palace?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Elephants, armies—take them all..",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Only give me the love that says,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "‘An elder has a younger brother!’”",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "So saying, generous Kumanan wept.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "But the feeling of enmity that had put down roots",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and grown in the younger brother would not subside.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The man whose heart had gone rotten said:",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Before the red-rayed one who ploughed across the sky returns,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "bow to my country and go to the forest!”",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "So he ordered him away.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 20
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "*",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 20
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Kumanan left.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 20,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "page-transition",
    "fromScan": 20,
    "toScan": 21,
    "stanzaRelation": "unknown",
    "textualRelation": "not-specifically-recorded",
    "evidence": {
     "stanza": [],
     "textual": []
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Deer, honey-birds, peacocks, cuckoos and house-pigeons",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "showed the king a love greater",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "than the human race displays,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and so he lived happily in the forest;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "but there was no poet to offer him sugarcane-sweet Tamil—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "that alone was his unending sorrow; there was no other!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "As treachery flared into flame,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the younger brother seized the sceptre into his own hand!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Was he content with that much?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Cruel friends stirred the resentment buried in his mind.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“I have been patient until this day—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "my elder brother has prepared to make war on me.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Do not stop me;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "for whoever cuts off my elder brother's head",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and brings it here,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "ten thousand gold pieces as reward!” he said.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“To cut off his head? What clan-destroying news is this!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 21
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "*",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 21
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "His heart is as vast as a sea that beats in waves;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "for every poet who fashions the art of Tamil,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "he is a spring of giving!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Mudiramalai itself will melt away—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "if the crowned king's head is cut off,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "all our blood will freeze!”",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "So saying, they spat upon",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the purse of gold the ruler displayed.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 21,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "page-transition",
    "fromScan": 21,
    "toScan": 22,
    "stanzaRelation": "unknown",
    "textualRelation": "not-specifically-recorded",
    "evidence": {
     "stanza": [],
     "textual": []
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "With the thought of stringing flowers of Tamil",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and placing them upon the victorious king's shoulder,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "a poet came;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "his name was Sathanar.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Learning that Kumanan was living in the forest,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "he grieved.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 22
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "*",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 22
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "It was like finding a grove in the desert,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "like meeting a breeze in the evening;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "in the morning Kumanan saw the poet,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and feasted deeply on Tamil written upon the palm-leaf!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“On that day you did not come, rare poet;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "today you have come to me in suffering.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Take my head to my younger brother,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "give it to him,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "receive its price,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and cure the disease of your poverty!”",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "said Kumanan—and drew his sword.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The poet stopped him—and left the forest!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Then he approached the younger brother,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "ruined by his own words.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 22
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "*",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "stanza-break",
    "evidence": "source-blank-line",
    "sourceScan": 22
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Where?” he asked—and loosed his shafts of speech:",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Your elder had believed,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "‘He who has a younger brother fears no army.’",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "You have cut your elder brother's throat;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "you promised gold as reward",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "to whoever cut off his head.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Here is the sword that severed his head—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "give me my reward,” he said.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The younger brother saw his elder's sword—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "and saw red upon the sword-point.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“Have you fallen, brother!”",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "he screamed and wailed.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Poisoned heart—frenzied heart—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "at the news that his elder had given his life,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "it burst like a mountain split by an explosion—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the younger brother's now-pure heart",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "cried aloud.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "“The ochre-robed Kumanan said in the forest,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "‘Even if I must give my life,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "I will give it only for precious Tamil.’",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Sinner, through the wrong you committed",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "I learned those golden words.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Run—go and fall at that man's feet;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "not merely your elder's life,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Tamil itself will come alive!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Come without delay;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "touch the sword-point!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "It is not blood—it is red colour,”",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "said the poet.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Why would Ilankumanan stand there any longer?",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 22,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "page-transition",
    "fromScan": 22,
    "toScan": 23,
    "stanzaRelation": "unknown",
    "textualRelation": "not-specifically-recorded",
    "evidence": {
     "stanza": [],
     "textual": []
    }
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "Like flies circling those who sell honey,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "a gathering of poets who weave verse in lofty Tamil",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "circled King Kumanan.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "At his feet Ilankumanan bowed and fell—",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the generous king embraced him.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The man who had consented",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "to give his head as a gift to Tamil Sathanar",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "now gave his younger brother",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "forgiveness as another gift.",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "The younger brother gave up the royal parasol,",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "saying he no longer wanted it;",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   },
   {
    "kind": "line",
    "text": "the elder brother gave it to Tamil!",
    "indent": 0,
    "sourceScan": 23,
    "printedPage": null
   }
